# New article sitemap

When publishing a listed article, add its URL to [`public/sitemap.xml`](mdc:public/sitemap.xml).

## Entry shape

```xml
   <url>
      <loc>https://www.hendoacademy.org/articles/<slug></loc>
      <lastmod>YYYY-MM-DD</lastmod>
      <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
      <priority>0.8</priority>
   </url>
```

- Place it with the other `/articles/...` entries (near the top for newly featured work).
- Include `<lastmod>` for new or substantially updated articles.
- Do not add unlisted articles (`listed: false` in `lib/articles.ts`).
- Keep extensionless paths (no `.html`).
